      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 37.73,
      "end_s": 52.17,
      "duration_s": 14.43,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "By the end of this video, you will know the four parts of the Costco machine. The thin margin, the membership card, the short shopping list, and the money it uses before it pays its suppliers.",
