    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "s06_sales",
      "segment": "m1_sales",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 57.57,
      "end_s": 89.63,
      "duration_s": 32.07,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Start with the size of it. In its financial year that ended in August twenty twenty-six, Costco sold two hundred and ninety-seven billion dollars worth of goods, up ten point one percent from two hundred and sixty-nine point nine billion the year before. It runs nine hundred and thirty-nine warehouses around the world, six hundred and forty-seven of them in the United States and Puerto Rico. By sales, it is one of the biggest retailers on the planet.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "worth of goods",
          "label": "items[0].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.44,
          "absolute_s": 69.0
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "up ten point one percent",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.4,
          "absolute_s": 69.96
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "It runs",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 18.71,
          "absolute_s": 76.28
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "It runs",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 18.71,
          "absolute_s": 76.28
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "results",
        "tenk"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "s07_margin",
      "segment": "m1_margin",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 89.63,
      "end_s": 117.0,
      "duration_s": 27.37,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "But look at what it keeps. After paying for the goods themselves, Costco's gross margin was about eleven point one percent of sales. Put another way, by our calculation, the average item was sold for only about twelve and a half percent more than it cost Costco to buy. Costco itself says it operates at significantly lower margins than most other retailers.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].until.cue",
          "cue": "gross margin was about",
          "label": "items[0].until.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 5.41,
          "absolute_s": 95.04
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].bars[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "gross margin was about",
          "label": "items[1].bars[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 5.41,
          "absolute_s": 95.04
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "by our calculation",
          "label": "items[1].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.89,
          "absolute_s": 100.53
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "Costco itself says",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 21.09,
          "absolute_s": 110.72
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
