    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "s13_price",
      "segment": "m2_price",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 202.47,
      "end_s": 236.83,
      "duration_s": 34.37,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "In September twenty twenty-four, Costco raised its basic fee in the United States and Canada from sixty to sixty-five dollars a year. The Executive membership went from one hundred and twenty to one hundred and thirty. The increase touched around fifty-two million memberships. Costco says the higher fee accounted for about thirty percent of the growth in its membership income in twenty twenty-six. The rest came from new members signing up and from members upgrading to the more expensive card.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].pages[0][0].cue",
          "cue": "to sixty-five",
          "label": "items[1].pages[0][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.27,
          "absolute_s": 210.74
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "The Executive membership",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.0,
          "absolute_s": 213.47
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].pages[0][0].cue",
          "cue": "to one hundred and thirty",
          "label": "items[2].pages[0][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 14.1,
          "absolute_s": 216.57
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Costco says the higher fee",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 19.94,
          "absolute_s": 222.41
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "Costco says the higher fee",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 19.94,
          "absolute_s": 222.41
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "fee",
        "tenk"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "s14_renew",
      "segment": "m2_renew",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 236.83,
      "end_s": 267.07,
      "duration_s": 30.23,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "And people keep paying. Costco reports a renewal rate of ninety-two point three percent in the United States and Canada. More than nine in ten members sign up again, year after year, even after a price increase. Worldwide, including the newer countries where Costco is still growing, the rate is eighty-nine point eight percent. For a subscription that people pay for in advance, those are remarkable numbers.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "More than nine in ten",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.17,
          "absolute_s": 247.0
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "sign up again",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.86,
          "absolute_s": 248.69
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Worldwide",
          "label": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.94,
          "absolute_s": 253.77
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "tenk"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "s15_fees",
      "segment": "m2_fees",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 267.07,
      "end_s": 286.57,
      "duration_s": 19.5,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Multiply millions of members by a yearly fee, and you get five point nine billion dollars in a single year. Fees have their own costs, so they are not pure profit. But they arrive almost regardless of what members buy, and they equal about half of Costco's operating profit.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "and you get",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.76,
          "absolute_s": 270.83
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "in a single year",
          "label": "items[3].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 6.21,
          "absolute_s": 273.28
        },
        {
          "param": "items[4].at.cue",
          "cue": "Fees have their own costs",
          "label": "items[4].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.34,
          "absolute_s": 275.41
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "But they arrive",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.28,
          "absolute_s": 279.35
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "tenk"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "p16_halves",
      "segment": "m2_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 286.57,
      "end_s": 309.57,
      "duration_s": 23.0,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the two halves of Costco. On one side, the store, selling goods at a thin margin. On the other side, the club, collecting fees every year. The low prices bring members in. The fees pay for the low prices. And because members have already paid, they keep coming back to get their money's worth.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "On one side, the store",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.94,
          "absolute_s": 290.51
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "cue": "On one side, the store",
          "label": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.94,
          "absolute_s": 290.51
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "cue": "the club, collecting fees",
          "label": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 9.78,
          "absolute_s": 296.35
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "cue": "The low prices bring members in",
          "label": "strokes[2].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 13.07,
          "absolute_s": 299.64
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[3].start.cue",
          "cue": "The fees pay for the low prices",
          "label": "strokes[3].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.3,
          "absolute_s": 301.87
        },
        {
          "param": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "The fees pay for the low prices",
          "label": "actions[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.6,
          "absolute_s": 302.17
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[4].start.cue",
          "cue": "they keep coming back",
          "label": "strokes[4].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 20.09,
          "absolute_s": 306.65
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
