      "end_s": 423.73,
      "duration_s": 21.63,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the difference. Here is a typical supermarket, with a long list of products, each selling a little. Here is Costco, with a short list, each selling a lot. Same shoppers, but the money is concentrated on far fewer items. That is what lets Costco squeeze the price on each one.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "Here is a typical supermarket",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 2.72,
          "absolute_s": 404.82
