    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "s32_exec",
      "segment": "m5_exec",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 546.8,
      "end_s": 574.57,
      "duration_s": 27.77,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Executive members pay double the basic fee. In return, they get back about two percent of what they spend, up to an annual limit. Costco had forty-two point three million of them last year. And they accounted for about seventy-five percent of Costco's sales worldwide. Two years earlier, there were thirty-five point four million. Every year, more members choose to pay the higher fee.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "they get back about two percent",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 4.85,
          "absolute_s": 551.65
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Costco had",
          "label": "items[2].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.19,
          "absolute_s": 556.99
        },
        {
          "param": "items[3].at.cue",
          "cue": "about seventy-five percent",
          "label": "items[3].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.68,
          "absolute_s": 562.48
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].bars[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "Two years earlier",
          "label": "items[2].bars[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 19.73,
          "absolute_s": 566.53
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "tenk",
        "fee"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "s33_why",
      "segment": "m5_why",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 574.57,
      "end_s": 591.07,
      "duration_s": 16.5,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Think about what that reward does. The more you spend at Costco, the more you get back, so the more you want to buy there instead of somewhere else. The fee makes you come back. The reward makes you spend more when you do.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The more you spend",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.31,
          "absolute_s": 577.88
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The fee makes you come back",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.02,
          "absolute_s": 585.59
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "The fee makes you come back",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 11.02,
          "absolute_s": 585.59
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "tenk"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "p34_machine",
      "segment": "m5_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 591.07,
      "end_s": 618.17,
      "duration_s": 27.1,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me put the whole machine together. Low prices bring members in. Members pay fees, which equal about half of the profit. A short list of products sells in huge volume, which keeps prices low. Fast sales let Costco use its suppliers' money. And the biggest spenders are rewarded for spending even more. Each part feeds the next.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "draw_start.cue",
          "cue": "Low prices bring members in",
          "label": "draw_start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.52,
          "absolute_s": 594.59
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "cue": "Low prices bring members in",
          "label": "strokes[0].start.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.52,
          "absolute_s": 594.59
        },
        {
          "param": "strokes[1].start.cue",
          "cue": "Members pay fees",
